    "title": "Senate Director Jose Hernandez Elected ASCLU President - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Natalia Quezada Liam Flenniken ,\n2 days ago Editor’s Note: This article has been translated into Spanish by El Eco Copy Editor Danessi Valiente. You can find the Spanish version here. On March 25, students elected junior Senate Director Jose Hernandez as Associated Students of California Lutheran University president for the 2026-27 school year. Hernandez, a junior, will officially assume the role May 1. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
